{"id":"direccio_n","lemma":"dirección","pos":"noun","rank":575,"glosses":["direction","address","management, or running of a business or organisation"],"ipa":"/diɾeɡˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"direcciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-direcci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Dame tu dirección.","en":"Give me your address.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/100292","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu dirección?","en":"What is your address?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453614","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Por cierto, ¿cuál es su dirección?","en":"By the way, what is your address?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599971","words":[null,null,{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"by the way"]]},{"text":"Huyeron en todas direcciones.","en":"They fled in all directions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707092","words":[{"g":"to flee, to run away","l":"huir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null]},{"text":"¿Puede decirme su nombre y dirección?","en":"May I have your name and address?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353640","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"name"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}